  <main>
    <h2>PNG Example: Funny Cat Meme-Inspired Image</h2>
    <figure>
      <img src="images/dog.png" alt="A funny cat with its mouth open, shown against a light checkerboard-style background.">
      <figcaption>PNG Example — an original example image made for this project.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <section>
      <h3>Image description</h3>
      <p>This funny image shows a wide-eyed cat with its mouth open, similar to reaction images people share in memes.</p>
      <h3>File type information</h3>
      <p>PNG stands for Portable Network Graphics. It uses lossless compression and is useful for crisp digital artwork, logos, and images that may need transparency.</p>
      <h3>Why I chose this image</h3>
      <p>I chose a funny cat reaction because cat memes are popular online, and PNG is a common format for digital graphics and meme images.</p>
      <h3>Source</h3>
      <p>This is original artwork created for this assignment, so it does not use an outside image source.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer><p>CSIT 121 · Lab 04 · Web Image Formats</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
